\subsubsection{Energy Summaries}
The system automatically generates energy summaries at different intervals:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Daily Summaries}: Total energy produced and consumed each day
    \item \textbf{Weekly Summaries}: Week-over-week production and consumption patterns
    \item \textbf{Monthly Summaries}: Monthly aggregates with performance metrics
\end{itemize}

Users can access these summaries through the reports section or have them automatically delivered via email.

\subsection{Payment Management Interface}
\label{subsec:payment-interface}

The payment management interface allows users to view and manage payment-related information.

\subsubsection{Payment Plans}
Administrators can create and manage payment plans with:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Plan Configuration}: Setting payment amounts, frequencies, and terms
    \item \textbf{Customer Assignment}: Assigning plans to specific customers
    \item \textbf{Special Conditions}: Configuring grace periods, early payment discounts, etc.
\end{itemize}

