\end{figure}

\subsubsection{Payment History}
Users can view payment history including:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Completed Payments}: List of past payments with transaction details
    \item \textbf{Pending Payments}: Payments in process but not yet completed
    \item \textbf{Failed Payments}: Transactions that failed with error details
    \item \textbf{Payment Receipts}: Downloadable receipts for completed payments
\end{itemize}

