    \item \textbf{Automatic Payments}: Setting up recurring payments
    \item \textbf{Manual Recording}: For payments made through external channels
\end{itemize}

The system provides confirmation and receipts for all payment transactions.

\subsection{Security and Alerts Interface}
\label{subsec:security-interface}

The security interface provides tools for monitoring and responding to security events.

\subsubsection{Alert Dashboard}
The alert dashboard displays:

\begin{itemize}
