    \item \textbf{Technical Support}: Direct technical assistance via email at support@nebula-power.com or phone at +1-555-SOLAR-HELP
    \item \textbf{Training Webinars}: Regular online training sessions for users (schedule available in the dashboard)
\end{itemize}

Support hours: Monday through Friday, 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM (UTC), with emergency support available 24/7 for critical issues.
